sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(Platform Auth)
    participant Server as NeMo Guardrails Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Engine as Guardrails Engine<br/>(in-process)
    participant Embed as Embedding Model<br/>(in-process ONNX/fastembed)
    participant LLM as Upstream LLM Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Chat Completion with Guardrails
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Platform Token
        Proxy->>Server: Forward (authenticated)<br/>X-Authorization header
        Server->>Engine: Evaluate input rails<br/>(in-memory)
        Engine->>Embed: Compute embeddings<br/>for semantic similarity
        Embed-->>Engine: Embedding vectors
        Note over Engine: Apply configured rails:<br/>self_check, content_safety,<br/>regex, hallucination, etc.
        Engine->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>(X-Authorization → Authorization)
        LLM-->>Engine: Chat completion response
        Note over Engine: Apply output rails:<br/>response validation
        Engine-->>Server: Guarded response
        Server-->>Proxy: JSON response
        Proxy-->>Client: Final response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: Guardrail Check (No LLM Generation)
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/guardrail/checks<br/>Auth: Platform Token
        Proxy->>Server: Forward (authenticated)<br/>X-Authorization header
        Server->>Engine: Evaluate input/output/tool rails only<br/>(in-memory, no LLM call)
        Engine->>Embed: Compute embeddings<br/>(if semantic rails configured)
        Embed-->>Engine: Embedding vectors
        Note over Engine: Rail evaluation only —<br/>no upstream LLM generation
        Engine-->>Server: Rail evaluation results
        Server-->>Proxy: JSON/NDJSON response<br/>(streaming or final)
        Proxy-->>Client: Guardrail check results
    end
